    case_00110 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_00111 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01000 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01001 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01010 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01011 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01100 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01101 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01110 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_01111 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_10000 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_10001 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_10010 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_10011 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
    case_10100 a b E hb h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 M hP,
